{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37381","headline":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 四 · 唐彦谦","name":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中年涉事熟，欲学唾面娄。\n逡巡避少年，赴秽不敢詶。\n旁人吁已甚，自喜计虑周。\n微劳消厚疚，残辱胜深忧。\n从知爲下安，处上反无俦。\n人生各有志，勇懦从所求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}